ect=&quot;&amp;quot;REFERENTEONFIELD&amp;quot;&quot;/>&lt;/tipoReferenteOrdine>&lt;xsl:if test=&quot;$Start/tns:datiReferentiOnField/tns:cognomeOnField&quot;>&lt;cognomeReferente>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;$Start/tns:datiReferentiOnField/tns:cognomeOnField&quot;/>&lt;/cognomeReferente>&lt;/xsl:if>&lt;xsl:if test=&quot;$Start/tns:datiReferentiOnField/tns:nomeOnField&quot;>&lt;nomeReferente>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;$Start/tns:datiReferentiOnField/tns:nomeOnField&quot;/>&lt;/nomeReferente>&lt;/xsl:if>&lt;xsl:if test=&quot;$Start/tns:datiReferentiOnField/tns:telefonoFissoOnField&quot;>&lt;telefonoFissoReferente>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;$Start/tns:datiReferentiOnField/tns:telefonoFissoOnField&quot;/>&lt;/telefonoFissoReferente>&lt;/xsl:if>&lt;xsl:if test=&quot;$Start/tns:datiReferentiOnField/tns:cellulareOnField&quot;>&lt;telefonoMobileReferente>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;$Start/tns:datiReferentiOnField/tns:cellulareOnField&quot;/>&lt;/telefonoMobileReferente>&lt;/xsl:if>&lt;/referente>&lt;/xsl:if>&lt;tipologiaAccesso>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;&amp;quot;DATI&amp;quot;&quot;/>&lt;/tipologiaAccesso>&lt;offerta>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;&amp;quot;FIBERSTREAM&amp;quot;&quot;/>&lt;/offerta>&lt;/ordine>&lt;xsl:if test=&quot;$Start/tns:idContratto&quot;>&lt;IDContratto>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;$Start/tns:idContratto&quot;/>&lt;/IDContratto>&lt;/xsl:if>&lt;xsl:if test=&quot;$RecuperoDatiIstat/Record[1]/COD_ISTAT_COMUNE&quot;>&lt;ISTATComune>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;$RecuperoDatiIstat/Record[1]/COD_ISTAT_COMUNE&quot;/>&lt;/ISTATComune>&lt;/xsl:if>&lt;xsl:if test=&quot;$Start/tns:indirizzoDatiClienteFinale/tns:localita&quot;>&lt;localita>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;$Start/tns:indirizzoDatiClienteFinale/tns:localita&quot;/>&lt;/localita>&lt;/xsl:if>&lt;offerta>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;&amp;quot;FIBERSTREAM&amp;quot;&quot;/>&lt;/offerta>&lt;flagNaked>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;'S'&quot;/>&lt;/flagNaked>&lt;IDRichiestaLocalizzatore>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;0&quot;/>&lt;/IDRichiestaLocalizzatore>&lt;xsl:if test=&quot;exists($Start/tns:idOfferta)&quot;>&lt;IDOfferta>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;xsd:int($Start/tns:idOfferta)&quot;/>&lt;/IDOfferta>&lt;/xsl:if>&lt;xsl:choose>&lt;xsl:when test=&quot;tib:compare-date(current-date(), $CalcoloGiornoLavorativo/parameters/tns1:Response/tns1:outputDate) !=0&quot;>&lt;DRO>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;$CalcoloGiornoLavorativo/parameters/tns1:Response/tns1:outputDate&quot;/>&lt;/DRO>&lt;/xsl:when>&lt;xsl:when test=&quot;(tib:compare-date(current-date(), $CalcoloGiornoLavorativo/parameters/tns1:Response/tns1:outputDate) !=0) or (tib:compare-time(xsd:time(substring-before(substring-after(xsd:string(current-dateTime()),'T'), '.')), xsd:time(substring-before(substring-after(xsd:string($calcoloDRO),'T'), '+'))) = -1)&quot;>&lt;DRO>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;xsd:date(substring-before(xsd:string(current-date()), &amp;quot;+&amp;quot;))&quot;/>&lt;/DRO>&lt;/xsl:when>&lt;xsl:otherwise>&lt;DRO>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;$CalcoloData/parameters/tns1:Response/tns1:outputDate&quot;/>&lt;/DRO>&lt;/xsl:otherwise>&lt;/xsl:choose>&lt;xsl:if test=&quot;$Start/tns:dac&quot;>&lt;DAC>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;$Start/tns:dac&quot;/>&lt;/DAC>&lt;/xsl:if>&lt;xsl:if test=&quot;($Start/tns:oao = 'ALB') and (string-length($Start/tns:codiceProgetto)>0) and contains($CodProgettoWL, $Start/tns:codiceProgetto)&quot;>&lt;ordineAssetWhiteList>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;'TIM EX BT'&quot;/>&lt;/ordineAssetWhiteList>&lt;/xsl:if>&lt;xsl:if test=&quot;$Start/tns:dataPrevistaAttivazione&quot;>&lt;dataPrevistaAttivazione>&lt;xsl:value-of select=&quot;$Start/tns:dataPrevistaAttivazione&quot;/>&lt;/dataPrevistaAttivazione>&lt;/xsl:if>&lt;/ns:RichiestaElement>&lt;/xsl:template>&lt;/xsl:stylesheet>"
